-&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 style="line-height: normal; font-weight: 700; margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 20px !important;"&gt;在美国封锁期间，伊朗主要石油码头仍空无一人&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: 1.4; margin: 12px 0 0 0; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important;"&gt;对船舶跟踪数据和欧盟卫星图像的分析显示，自八月下旬以来，没有油轮停靠在哈格岛的原油出口码头。这是自伊朗战争开始以来该岛最长时间的不活动状态。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 40px; text-align: center; line-height: 40px; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px !important;"&gt;阅读更多&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="border-top: 1px solid; margin: 24px 0 0 0;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;股市周一上涨&lt;/strong&gt;，在上周全面回落后&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/DsZxc9eHYQY2hq7pUD0enXRwCvwXV0ibBi85c8uEWw_201uqwco1BXtog3LFIoAkLYjIBH3ePeFhoHB4r4JeOZdeH-ancHqcIco6tzmAvzTC-B0NhQbEJ4zXQb5UX9BfHlczma-_wBwN7BYzE2pNuAwzYwaQ3F3B04MFj7QKNUriktvTbpbOUL0JKp0Jq-UHc2f8eC9fDINIPNeXQgSXgiFRbPpxf87blrjwvZmoyTlsySzOSgji0dVbcqQP9lfhQr5mi1DihZN6ecC2SoKRYSNDcUnenNId6ywOrEqmFYdXfVkae2DjY5u5aK2Gzw35kIPk-xSQDXj120s2ouL8lQi1iW_Dsin3xGl0YVpaRVrBsci8cvwkUHpQnYn_bror0AKQMa9tJx-xpp0P2K4-rgvDyOgQoVIaO3ikoyHDlgi6Sg2XUiYFtcX4u1ZZG9dVMIlWcdh1kJ_z4iuGtaP--cy0VurmZABjxTb6p8nF1hT_JRZbwKh1Nx-lQmynTec/dlOxzo8uQZoiSs_MJBboZtFbnlLnrpXv/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="纳斯达克 100 指数因人工智能交易在溃败后复苏而攀升：市场结束"&gt;稍稍松了一口气&lt;/a&gt;。但对于科技股和喜爱它们的投资者来说，仍然有一些发人深省的消息。高盛的主要部门表示，对冲基金已&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/3_--TELitRakPMty0hvhG7gaU0OI_v2aHbWb2CUYI_Mz-k4R0FxvI68hXbSaiYfFPLmbzMfY21e5hZy2wuSwBxgGVZOnw-qaulh6exYgdfzqb5d9XliYg6M3UgKJ2YnhQmu_cVHquITX9i69EhF1eWtsg_99CzFkDGN47l_y1YV7EatVcCXzPFQfObkhIrFsygyCG3KcxKlUqyV0f49oT-OdPJQdsg2sDtdNEqZlVep1RdZUaBx16gJVdeIe5PbnGvQgsNECxTki5SgOHTj-Mq-tXsjMYQ2uNBclebAKAYD0-cf-r3X3cfV_oi4Uw9ZV1NOfXfVjKpQVVt4jBKY4QlPVFfSs9QlysUg8MAlakRQ_dhFinOkkzeNBLDyyIZzRoa